athar', 'Markov Blademaster', 'Markov Warlord', 'Midnight Guard', 'Mikaeus, the Unhallowed', "Mondronen Shaman // Tovolar's Magehunter", 'Moonveil Dragon', 'Mystic Retrieval', 'Nearheath Stalker', 'Nephalia Seakite', 'Niblis of the Breath', 'Niblis of the Mist', 'Niblis of the Urn', 'Predator Ooze', 'Pyreheart Wolf', 'Ravenous Demon // Archdemon of Greed', 'Ray of Revelation', 'Reap the Seagraf', 'Relentless Skaabs', 'Requiem Angel', 'Russet Wolves', 'Sanctuary Cat', 'Saving Grasp', 'Scorch the Fields', 'Scorned Villager // Moonscarred Werewolf', 'Screeching Skaab', 'Secrets of the Dead', 'Shattered Perception', 'Shriekgeist', 'Sightless Ghoul', 'Silverclaw Griffin', 'Skillful Lunge', 'Skirsdag Flayer', 'Somberwald Dryad', 'Sorin, Lord of Innistrad', 'Soul Seizer // Ghastly Haunting', 'Spiteful Shadows', 'Stormbound Geist', 'Strangleroot Geist', 'Stromkirk Captain', 'Sudden Disappearance', 'Séance', 'Talons of Falkenrath', 'Thalia, Guardian of Thraben', 'Thought Scour', 'Thraben Doomsayer', 'Thraben Heretic', 'Torch Fiend', 'Tower Geist', "Tracker's Instincts", 'Tragic Slip', 'Ulvenwald Bear', 'Undying Evil', 'Vault of the Archangel', 'Vengeful Vampire', 'Village Survivors', 'Vorapede', 'Wakedancer', 'Warden of the Wall', 'Wild Hunger', 'Wolfbitten Captive // Krallenhorde Killer', "Wolfhunter's Quiver", 'Wrack with Madness', 'Young Wolf', 'Zombie Apocalypse']
