text: ['Altar of the Lost enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add two mana in any combination of colors. Spend this mana only to cast spells with flashback from a graveyard.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, exile a creature card from your graveyard.\nHeadless Skaab enters the battlefield tapped.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, exile a creature card from your graveyard.\nUndying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nFling deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power to any target.", 'At the beginning of each upkeep, if no spells were cast last turn, transform Afflicted Deserter.', 'At the beginning of each upkeep, if no spells were cast last turn, transform Hinterland Hermit.', 'At the beginning of each upkeep, if no spells were cast last turn, transform Lambholt Elder.', 'At the beginning of each upkeep, if no spells were cast last turn, transform Mondronen Shaman.', "At the beginning of each upkeep, you may exile target creature card from your graveyard. If you do, create a token that's a copy of that card, except it's a Spirit in addition to its other types. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.", "At the beginning of your end step, you may sacrifice a nontoken creature. If you do, create X 2/2 green Wolf creature tokens, where X is the sacrificed creature's toughness.", 'Burning Oil deals 3 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.\nFlashback {3}{W} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Choose one —\n• Destroy target creature with flying.\n• Destroy target artifact.', 'Copy target instant or sorcery spell you control. If this spell was cast from a graveyard, copy that spell twice instead. You may choose new targets for the copies.\nFlashback {3}{R}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Counter target creature spell.\nDraw a card.', 'Counter target spell. You may cast a spell that shares a card type with it from your hand without paying its mana cost.', 'Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.\nFlashback {4}{U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Create five 1/1 white Human creature tokens. If this spell was cast from a graveyard, create ten of those tokens instead.\nFlashback {7}{W}{W} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Create two 1/1 white Human creature tokens.\nFateful hour — If you have 5 or less life, create five of those tokens instead.', 'Create two 1/1 white Spirit creature tokens with flying.\nFlashback {1}{B} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', "Creature cards in graveyards and libraries can't enter the battlefield.\nPlayers can't cast spells from graveyards or libraries.", 'Creatures you control get +0/+4 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.\nFateful hour — If you have 5 or less life, those creatures gain indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy them.)', 'Deathtouch\nOther Zombie creatures you control get +1/+1.\nWhenever another Zombie you control dies, target opponent loses 1 life.', 'Destroy target creature. If that creature was a Human, you gain life equal to its toughness.', 'Destroy target enchantment.\nFlashback {G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Destroy target land. Scorch the Fields deals 1 damage to each Human creature.', 'Discard all the cards in your hand, then draw that many cards.\nFlashback {5}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Double strike\nWhenever Markov Blademaster deals combat damage to a player, put a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Draw a card for each creature card in your graveyard.', 'Draw two cards, then discard two cards.\nFlashback {2}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Draw two cards.', 'Each player mills five cards.\nFlashback {7}{U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Enchant creature\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may look at the top five cards of your library. If you do, you may put a creature card that shares a creature type with enchanted creature from among them onto the battlefield, then you put the rest of those cards on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets -13/-0.', 'Enchant creature\nWhenever enchanted creature blocks, you gain 3 life.', 'Enchant creature\nWhenever enchanted creature is dealt damage, it deals that much damage to its controller.', 'Enchant creature\nYou control enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\n{1}: Tap enchanted creature.', "Enchant player\nAt the beginning of enchanted player's upkeep, Curse of Thirst deals damage to that player equal to the number of Curses attached to them.", "Enchant player\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may search your library for a Curse card that doesn't have the same name as a Curse attached to enchanted player, put it onto the battlefield attached to that player, then shuffle.", "Enchant player\nEnchanted player can't cast more than one spell each turn.", 'Enchant player\nIf a source would deal damage to enchanted player, it deals double that damage to that player instead.', 'Enchant player\nWhenever enchanted player casts an instant or sorcery spell, each other player may copy that spell and may choose new targets for the copy they control.', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0 and has vigilance.\nWhenever equipped creature dies, if it was a Human, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.\nEquip {2}', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0.\nWhen equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, unattach Elbrus, the Binding Blade, then transform it.\nEquip {1}', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+1.\nAs long as equipped creature is a Human, it gets an additional +1/+1.\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Equipped creature has "{T}: This creature deals 1 damage to any target" and "{T}: This creature deals 3 damage to target Werewolf creature."\nEquip {5}', "Equipped creature has intimidate. (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "Exile all nonland permanents target player controls. Return the exiled cards to the battlefield under their owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", 'Fateful hour — As long as you have 5 or less life, other creatures you control get +1/+4.', 'Fires of Undeath deals 2 damage to any target.\nFlashback {5}{B} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'First strike\nNoncreature spells cost {1} more to cast.', 'First strike\nOther Vampire creatures you control get +1/+1 and have first strike.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature has "{1}{R}: This creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn."', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\nFlying', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\nFlying\nWhen Hollowhenge Spirit enters the battlefield, remove target attacking or blocking creature from combat.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\nWhen Briarpack Alpha enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Flying\nOther Spirit creatures you control get +1/+1 and have hexproof. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", "Flying\nStormbound Geist can block only creatures with flying.\nUndying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", "Flying\nUndying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", "Flying\nWhen Dungeon Geists enters the battlefield, tap target creature an opponent controls. That creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step for as long as you control Dungeon Geists.", 'Flying\nWhen Niblis of the Mist enters the battlefield, you may tap target creature.', 'Flying\nWhen Soul Seizer deals combat damage to a player, you may transform it. If you do, attach it to target creature that player controls.', 'Flying\nWhen Tower Geist enters the battlefield, look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', 'Flying\nWhenever Fiend of the Shadows deals combat damage to a player, that player exiles a card from their hand. You may play that card for as long as it remains exiled.\nSacrifice a Human: Regenerate Fiend of the Shadows.', 'Flying\nWhenever Niblis of the Urn attacks, you may tap target creature.', 'Flying\nWhenever Shriekgeist deals combat damage to a player, that player mills two cards.', 'Flying\nWhenever another non-Spirit creature you control dies, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', 'Flying\n{R}: Each creature you control gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{U}, {T}: You may tap or untap target creature.', 'Flying, double strike, lifelink\nWhenever you gain life, draw a card.', 'Flying, first strike', 'Flying, haste\nSacrifice a creature: Falkenrath Aristocrat gains indestructible until end of turn. If the sacrificed creature was a Human, put a +1/+1 counter on Falkenrath Aristocrat.', "Flying, intimidate, trample (A creature with intimidate can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)\nWhenever a player loses the game, put thirteen +1/+1 counters on Withengar Unbound.", "Flying, trample\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice a Human. If you can't, tap Archdemon of Greed and it deals 9 damage to you.", "Forestwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", "Geralf's Messenger enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Geralf's Messenger enters the battlefield, target opponent loses 2 life.\nUndying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", "Gravecrawler can't block.\nYou may cast Gravecrawler from your graveyard as long as you control a Zombie.", "Haste\nUndying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", "Haste\nWhen Markov Warlord enters the battlefield, up to two target creatures can't block this turn.", 'Haste\nWhenever Erdwal Ripper deals combat damage to a player, put a +1/+1 counter on it.', "Haste\nWhenever a creature you control attacks, Hellrider deals 1 damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.", 'Hinterland Scourge must be blocked if able.\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if a player cast two or more spells last turn, transform Hinterland Scourge.', 'Indestructible\nWhenever Predator Ooze attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on it.\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Predator Ooze this turn dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Predator Ooze.', "Intimidate (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)", "Intimidate (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)\nEach other creature you control that's a Wolf or a Werewolf gets +1/+1.\nNon-Human Werewolves you control can't transform.", "Intimidate (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)\nWhenever a Human deals damage to you, destroy it.\nOther non-Human creatures you control get +1/+1 and have undying. (When a creature with undying dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", 'Lifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)\nWhen Elgaud Inquisitor dies, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', 'Morbid — When Ulvenwald Bear enters the battlefield, if a creature died this turn, put two +1/+1 counters on target creature.', 'Morbid — When Wakedancer enters the battlefield, if a creature died this turn, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', "Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.\nFateful hour — If you have 5 or less life, tap all attacking creatures. Those creatures don't untap during their controller's next untap step.", 'Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\nMorbid — Put three +1/+1 counters on that creature instead if a creature died this turn.', 'Put any number of target creature cards from your graveyard on top of your library.\nDraw a card.', 'Put five +1/+1 counters on target creature. If this spell was cast from a graveyard, put ten +1/+1 counters on that creature instead.\nFlashback {5}{G}{G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', "Put target creature on top of its owner's library.", 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Return all Zombie creature cards from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped, then destroy all Humans.', 'Return target creature you own to your hand.\nFlashback {W} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.\nFlashback {2}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Reveal the top four cards of your library. Put a creature card from among them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.\nFlashback {2}{U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Sacrifice a Human: Transform Ravenous Demon. Activate only as a sorcery.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Falkenrath Torturer gains flying until end of turn. If the sacrificed creature was a Human, put a +1/+1 counter on Falkenrath Torturer.', 'Search your library for a card and put that card into your hand. If this spell was cast from a graveyard, instead search your library for two cards and put those cards into your hand. Then shuffle.\nFlashback {7}{B} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', "Sightless Ghoul can't block.\nUndying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", 'Target creature an opponent controls deals damage equal to its power to each other creature that player controls, then each of those creatures deals damage equal to its power to that creature.', "Target creature can't be blocked this turn.\nFlashback {U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)", 'Target creature deals damage to itself equal to its power.', 'Target creature fights another target creature. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)', 'Target creature gains deathtouch until end of turn and must be blocked this turn if able.\nFlashback {G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', "Target creature gains undying until end of turn. (When it dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", 'Target creature gets +2/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+1 and gains trample until end of turn.\nFlashback {3}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.\nMorbid — That creature gets -13/-13 until end of turn instead if a creature died this turn.', 'Target permanent you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.\nFateful hour — If you have 5 or less life, instead you and each permanent you control gain protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Target player discards two cards.\nMorbid — If a creature died this turn, instead that player reveals their hand, you choose two cards from it, then that player discards those cards.', 'Target player draws three cards and loses 3 life.', 'Target player mills X cards. If this spell was cast from a graveyard, that player mills twice that many cards instead.\nFlashback {X}{U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Target player mills two cards.\nDraw a card.', 'This spell costs {1} less to cast for each creature card in your graveyard.', 'Trample\nMorbid — Gravetiller Wurm enters the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it if a creature died this turn.', "Trample\nWhenever this creature transforms into Ravager of the Fells, it deals 2 damage to target opponent or planeswalker and 2 damage to up to one target creature that player or that planeswalker's controller controls.\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if a player cast two or more spells last turn, transform Ravager of the Fells.", "Undying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", "Undying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)\nWhenever Flayer of the Hatebound or another creature enters the battlefield from your graveyard, that creature deals damage equal to its power to any target.", "Unhallowed Cathar can't block.", 'Vigilance\nFateful hour — As long as you have 5 or less life, other creatures you control have vigilance.', 'Vigilance\nWhen Loyal Cathar dies, return it to the battlefield transformed under your control at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Vigilance\n{T}: Add {G}{G}.\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if a player cast two or more spells last turn, transform Moonscarred Werewolf.', "Vigilance, trample\nUndying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", "Warden of the Wall enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {C}.\nAs long as it's not your turn, Warden of the Wall is a 2/3 Gargoyle artifact creature with flying.", 'When Black Cat dies, target opponent discards a card at random.', 'When Farbog Boneflinger enters the battlefield, target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'When Forge Devil enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to target creature and 1 damage to you.', "When Geralf's Mindcrusher enters the battlefield, target player mills five cards.\nUndying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", 'When Screeching Skaab enters the battlefield, mill two cards.', "Whenever Pyreheart Wolf attacks, creatures you control gain menace until end of turn. (They can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\nUndying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", 'Whenever Silverpelt Werewolf deals combat damage to a player, draw a card.\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if a player cast two or more spells last turn, transform Silverpelt Werewolf.', "Whenever a creature attacks you or a planeswalker you control, reveal the top card of your library. If it's a Forest card, remove that creature from combat. Then put the revealed card on the bottom of your library.", 'Whenever a creature you control dies, put two eyeball counters on Jar of Eyeballs.\n{3}, {T}, Remove all eyeball counters from Jar of Eyeballs: Look at the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of eyeball counters removed this way. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', "Whenever an opponent casts a spell, Tovolar's Magehunter deals 2 damage to that player.\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if a player cast two or more spells last turn, transform Tovolar's Magehunter.", 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, untap Midnight Guard.', 'Whenever this creature enters the battlefield or transforms into Huntmaster of the Fells, create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token and you gain 2 life.\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if no spells were cast last turn, transform Huntmaster of the Fells.', "Whenever this creature transforms into Werewolf Ransacker, you may destroy target artifact. If that artifact is put into a graveyard this way, Werewolf Ransacker deals 3 damage to that artifact's controller.\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if a player cast two or more spells last turn, transform Werewolf Ransacker.", 'Whenever you cast a spell from your graveyard, draw a card.', 'You gain 2 life for each card in your graveyard, then shuffle your graveyard into your library.', '[+1]: Create a 1/1 black Vampire creature token with lifelink.\n[−2]: You get an emblem with "Creatures you control get +1/+0."\n[−6]: Destroy up to three target creatures and/or other planeswalkers. Return each card put into a graveyard this way to the battlefield under your control.', "{1}, {T}: Exile target creature you control.\n{7}, {T}: Exile target creature you don't control.\nWhen Helvault is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return all cards exiled with it to the battlefield under their owners' control.", '{1}: You may cast target creature card in a graveyard this turn. When you cast it this turn, Havengul Lich gains all activated abilities of that card until end of turn.', '{1}{G}, Sacrifice a Human: Put two +1/+1 counters on target creature.', '{1}{G}: Wolfbitten Captive gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if no spells were cast last turn, transform Wolfbitten Captive.', '{2}{R}: Target creature attacks this turn if able.', '{2}{U}, {T}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token, then put a +1/+1 counter on each Zombie creature you control.', '{3}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice a Human: Destroy target creature.', '{3}{G}: Krallenhorde Killer gets +4/+4 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if a player cast two or more spells last turn, transform Krallenhorde Killer.', '{G}, Sacrifice Dawntreader Elk: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{R}, Sacrifice Torch Fiend: Destroy target artifact.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}, Tap an untapped Vampire you control: Transform Chosen of Markov.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}{W}{B}, {T}: Creatures you control gain deathtouch and lifelink until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Haunted Fengraf: Return a creature card at random from your graveyard to your hand.', '{T}: Add {G}.\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if no spells were cast last turn, transform Scorned Villager.', '{T}: Create a 1/1 white Human creature token.\nFateful hour — As long as you have 5 or less life, other creatures you control get +2/+2.', '{T}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard.', '{T}: Gain control of target creature with power less than or equal to the number of creatures you control.', '{T}: Target player loses 5 life.', '{T}: You gain 1 life. Then if you have at least 10 life more than your starting life total, transform Chalice of Life.']
